    "text": "Pakistani freelancers ki record kamai, sirf October mein $210 million! 💻\nAPP ke mutabiq Finance Minister ke Advisor Khurram Schehzad ne Wednesday ko bataya ke October 2026 mein freelancers ki export kamai $210 million rahi. Yeh ab tak kisi bhi ek mahine ki sab se zyada kamai hai, aur pichle saal October ke muqable mein 53 feesad zyada hai. July se October tak freelancers ne $760 million kamaye, jabke pichle saal isi arse mein $515 million kamaye the, yaani 47 feesad izafa. Unhon ne kaha ke agar yehi raftar rahi to is saal kamai $2 billion se barh sakti hai.\nKya aap bhi freelancing karte hain? Comment mein batayein 👇\n\nImage: AI-generated illustration.\n\n#RiseUpPakistan #Freelancing #Freelancers #PakistanEconomy #PakistanNews",
